  {
   "id": "mlp",
   "short": "MLP",
   "title": "Major League Pickleball",
   "dek": "Coed teams, four games a match, and a singles relay when it's tied. The 2026 season is done; the New Jersey 5s won it.",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "facts",
     "items": [
      {
       "fact": "New Jersey 5s beat the St. Louis Shock in the 2026 Finals at CityPickle at Wollman Rink in Central Park on Aug 30, their first MLP title. Federico Staksrud was Finals MVP.",
       "source": "https://www.thedinkpickleball.com/the-new-jersey-fives-take-home-the-2026-mlp-championship/"
      },
      {
       "fact": "Up next: the first MLP Nations Cup, Oct 30–Nov 1 in Dallas, with regional teams. It opens the PPA World Championships week. Every match on PickleballTV.",
       "source": "https://majorleaguepickleball.co/events-2026/mlp-nations-cup/"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "heading": "How a match works",
     "type": "facts",
     "items": [
      {
       "fact": "A team match is four games: women's doubles, men's doubles, then two mixed doubles. Tied 2–2 means a fifth game, the DreamBreaker.",
       "source": "https://majorleaguepickleball.co/faq/"
      },
      {
       "fact": "DreamBreaker: singles where each team rotates its players every four points, rally scoring to 21, win by two. The home team names its order first.",
       "source": "https://majorleaguepickleball.co/faq/"
      },
      {
       "fact": "Doubles games use side-out scoring to 11, win by 2.",
       "source": "https://majorleaguepickleball.co/abcs-of-mlp/"
      },
      {
       "fact": "20 teams in 2026, all in one league. At each regular-season event 11 teams play round-robin Thursday to Saturday, and Sunday head-to-heads award standings points.",
       "source": "https://majorleaguepickleball.co/abcs-of-mlp/"
      },
      {
       "fact": "Top 12 make the playoffs; seeds 1–4 get byes. First round in Dallas, quarterfinals in Newport Beach, semis and finals in New York.",
       "source": "https://majorleaguepickleball.co/abcs-of-mlp/"
      }
     ]
    },
